<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Australian 13-week T-note yields 6.365 pct.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Australian 13-week T-note yields 6.365 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Reserve Bank of Australia said the result of this week's T-note tender was as follows:</p>
<p> 13-week -    Amount	Av. yield   Range	 Previous</p>
<p>		  AS200 million   6.365	 6.36-6.36   6.527</p>
<p>		  (RBA take-up A$100 million, pct allotted at top 100)</p>
<p> 5-week  -    Amount	Av. yield   Range	 Previous</p>
<p>		  AS600 million   6.408	 6.39-6.41   6.683</p>
<p>		  (RBA take-up A$200 million, pct allotted at top 77)</p>
<p> 26-week -    Amount	Av. yield   Range	 Previous</p>
<p>		  AS300 million   6.339	 6.33-6.34   6.502</p>
<p>		  (RBA take-up A$100 million, pct allotted at top 87)</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
